  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Existe un Pokémon con cuerpo de plasma, capaz\nde meterse en diversos electrodomésticos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Por supuesto, hablamos de Rotom!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10050006F007200200073007500700075006500730074006F002C0020006800610062006C0061006D006F007300200064006500200052006F0074006F006D002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Veo que tú también tienes un SmartRotom.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560065006F00200071007500650020007400FA002000740061006D0062006900E9006E0020007400690065006E0065007300200075006E00200053006D0061007200740052006F0074006F006D002E00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es un artículo preciado, ya que su valor depende\ndel número de especímenes de Rotom<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nen la actualidad.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los SmartRotom son excepcionales, pero\nel verdadero cometido de los Rotom es entrar<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nen electrodomésticos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 113
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué te parece un combate contra Rotom en\nsus diversas formas?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E9002000740065002000700061007200650063006500200075006E00200063006F006D006200610074006500200063006F006E00740072006100200052006F0074006F006D00200065006E000A00730075007300200064006900760065007200730061007300200066006F0072006D00610073003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Avísame si tienes ganas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041007600ED00730061006D00650020007300690020007400690065006E00650073002000670061006E00610073002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Me pregunto en qué electrodomésticos se\nmeterá!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D0065002000700072006500670075006E0074006F00200065006E00200071007500E900200065006C0065006300740072006F0064006F006D00E90073007400690063006F0073002000730065000A006D006500740065007200E1002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quieres combatir contra Rotom en sus distintas\nformas?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005100750069006500720065007300200063006F006D0062006100740069007200200063006F006E00740072006100200052006F0074006F006D00200065006E0020007300750073002000640069007300740069006E007400610073000A0066006F0072006D00610073003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Sí!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005300ED00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Todavía no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F00640061007600ED00610020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No te hagas rogar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00200074006500200068006100670061007300200072006F006700610072002E00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Señoras y señores, contemplen a Rotom! ¡Vean\ncómo se mete en todo tipo de electrodomésticos!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n¡Ahí va el primero!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 121
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Qué nervios!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10051007500E90020006E0065007200760069006F0073002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Cuando toma posesión de un horno eléctrico,\nse convierte en Rotom Calor!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Es de tipo Eléctrico y Fuego! ¡Y mira eso! Ya no\nes de tipo Fantasma.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Además, conoce el movimiento Supercalor!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004100640065006D00E10073002C00200063006F006E006F0063006500200065006C0020006D006F00760069006D00690065006E0074006F00200053007500700065007200630061006C006F0072002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si está de buen humor, hornea al punto justo.\nPero si se le cruzan los cables, ¡te calcina!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Prepárate para conocer el poder de Rotom!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000720065007000E100720061007400650020007000610072006100200063006F006E006F00630065007200200065006C00200070006F00640065007200200064006500200052006F0074006F006D002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué te pareció mi Rotom Calor?\n¿Avivó las llamas de la venganza?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E9002000740065002000700061007200650063006900F30020006D006900200052006F0074006F006D002000430061006C006F0072003F000A00BF004100760069007600F30020006C006100730020006C006C0061006D006100730020006400650020006C0061002000760065006E00670061006E007A0061003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡El siguiente es Rotom Lavado! Está metido en\nuna lavadora, por si no te diste cuenta.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ganará limpiamente!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100470061006E0061007200E10020006C0069006D007000690061006D0065006E00740065002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Rotom Lavado es de tipo Eléctrico y Agua!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10052006F0074006F006D0020004C0061007600610064006F0020006500730020006400650020007400690070006F00200045006C00E900630074007200690063006F0020007900200041006700750061002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Su ataque Hidrobomba te limpiará\nhasta la sombra!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100530075002000610074006100710075006500200048006900640072006F0062006F006D006200610020007400650020006C0069006D007000690061007200E1000A006800610073007400610020006C006100200073006F006D006200720061002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Incluso tiene una función para cancelar el lavado\nsi se te olvida el detergente! ¡Es tan útil!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pero cuidado porque también te puede inundar\nla casa!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000650072006F0020006300750069006400610064006F00200070006F0072007100750065002000740061006D0062006900E9006E00200074006500200070007500650064006500200069006E0075006E006400610072000A006C006100200063006100730061002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué te pareció mi Rotom Lavado? ¿Necesitas\nahogar tus penas? O más bien... ¿desahogarlas?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y ahora es el momento de cortar el césped con...\n¡Rotom Podadora!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059002000610068006F0072006100200065007300200065006C0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F00200064006500200063006F007200740061007200200065006C0020006300E9007300700065006400200063006F006E002E002E002E000A00A10052006F0074006F006D00200050006F006400610064006F00720061002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡El poder de podar!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045006C00200070006F00640065007200200064006500200070006F006400610072002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\"",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00220000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Rotom Podadora es de tipo Eléctrico y Planta!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10052006F0074006F006D00200050006F006400610064006F007200610020006500730020006400650020007400690070006F00200045006C00E900630074007200690063006F0020007900200050006C0061006E00740061002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Conoce el movimiento Tormenta de Hojas!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006E006F0063006500200065006C0020006D006F00760069006D00690065006E0074006F00200054006F0072006D0065006E0074006100200064006500200048006F006A00610073002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El problema es tener un jardín lo bastante grande\ncomo para poder usarlo, pero eso ya es otro tema.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Además fanfarronea y te desparrama todo\nel césped recién cortado por ahí!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿'",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué te pareció mi Rotom Podadora?\n¿Te vas a \"podar\" recuperar?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E9002000740065002000700061007200650063006900F30020006D006900200052006F0074006F006D00200050006F006400610064006F00720061003F000A00BF00540065002000760061007300200061002000220070006F00640061007200220020007200650063007500700065007200610072003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahora es el turno de ver a Rotom Ventilador, que\nes un Rotom metido en un... ¡Bueno, es obvio!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ten cuidado porque te va a volar la cabeza!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100540065006E0020006300750069006400610064006F00200070006F00720071007500650020007400650020007600610020006100200076006F006C006100720020006C006100200063006100620065007A0061002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Rotom Ventilador es de tipo Eléctrico y Volador!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10052006F0074006F006D002000560065006E00740069006C00610064006F00720020006500730020006400650020007400690070006F00200045006C00E900630074007200690063006F0020007900200056006F006C00610064006F0072002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Conoce el movimiento Corte Aéreo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006E006F0063006500200065006C0020006D006F00760069006D00690065006E0074006F00200043006F0072007400650020004100E900720065006F002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Y, además, tiene control de voz para poder\nelegir los movimientos a distancia!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero es algo travieso y, si te descuidas, hará que\ntus documentos importantes salgan volando.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 5780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Y? ¿Se volaron tus aires de grandeza?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 5792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0059003F002000BF0053006500200076006F006C00610072006F006E00200074007500730020006100690072006500730020006400650020006700720061006E00640065007A0061003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Y por último, Rotom Frío! Así es como se llama\nRotom cuando se mete en un refrigerador.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 5880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te dejará helad<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100540065002000640065006A0061007200E1002000680065006C0061006400100003110000FF0101006F0061002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿4",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Rotom Frío es de tipo Eléctrico y Hielo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 6140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10052006F0074006F006D00200046007200ED006F0020006500730020006400650020007400690070006F00200045006C00E900630074007200690063006F002000790020004800690065006C006F002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Conoce el movimiento Ventisca!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 6232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006E006F0063006500200065006C0020006D006F00760069006D00690065006E0074006F002000560065006E00740069007300630061002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Su aire gélido congela todo a su alrededor!\nHmm, creo que no lo estoy vendiendo muy bien...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 6304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por cierto, tengo entendido que Rotom cambia de\nforma por algo de un motor especial.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 6500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿9",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 6680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "De tanto hablar de los Rotom, ni me había\nenterado de que el combate había terminado.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 6692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En Galar existen otras formas como el Rotom\nDron o la Bici Rotom.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 6872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E002000470061006C006100720020006500780069007300740065006E0020006F007400720061007300200066006F0072006D0061007300200063006F006D006F00200065006C00200052006F0074006F006D000A00440072006F006E0020006F0020006C00610020004200690063006900200052006F0074006F006D002E00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pero, tenga la forma que tenga, es muy travieso!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 7012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000650072006F002C002000740065006E006700610020006C006100200066006F0072006D00610020007100750065002000740065006E00670061002C0020006500730020006D0075007900200074007200610076006900650073006F002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Puede que los Rotom no sean muy fáciles de\nusar como electrodomésticos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 7120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero seguro que alguien como tú sabrá\naprovecharlos como se debe en combate.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 7272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Por eso te regalo este catálogo para\ncambiar de forma a los Rotom!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 7436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10050006F0072002000650073006F00200074006500200072006500670061006C006F00200065007300740065002000630061007400E1006C006F0067006F00200070006100720061000A00630061006D006200690061007200200064006500200066006F0072006D0061002000610020006C006F007300200052006F0074006F006D002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si atrapas algún Rotom salvaje, pruébalo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 7580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020006100740072006100700061007300200061006C006700FA006E00200052006F0074006F006D002000730061006C00760061006A0065002C002000700072007500E900620061006C006F002E00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Según se vayan inventando nuevas máquinas y\nartilugios, supongo que los Rotom también se<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nadaptarán a ellos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 7672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 115
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hay un sinfín de posibilidades con los Rotom!\n¡Rotom infinitos y más allá!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 7904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿C",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 8064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Usaste el catálogo para cambiar de forma a\nalgún Rotom?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 8076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00550073006100730074006500200065006C002000630061007400E1006C006F0067006F00200070006100720061002000630061006D006200690061007200200064006500200066006F0072006D006100200061000A0061006C006700FA006E00200052006F0074006F006D003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Algún día los Rotom podrán meterse en todas\nlas máquinas. Imagina el caos que causarán.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 8200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rototo...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 8384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052006F0074006F0074006F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    }
